  "bundle_request_count": 16,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:0ddd1f48f908b2ddb7fdb3dc38be924f1e89389221717ff0bb6306e351bb9196",
      "request_id": "0ddd1f48f908b2ddb7fdb3dc38be924f1e89389221717ff0bb6306e351bb9196",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "399d38be93437654365427a32a981c19",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "开场二比零，施晗先拿到优势。可是这一局，她又被逼到破发点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0bfc303a52500f1e911a9ced9bc3a4ad4a9d3592efc5bcd4c2f5b37ccd85dfef",
      "words_sha256": "8cd98cfc0e3e68fb8a6b1d0dca57b77b5be88f622f1591843562350f61c93c71"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:170c009562d0f1567d79950a676bb3dcd404b1ec670a7084a47cabee81c0f1d0",
      "request_id": "170c009562d0f1567d79950a676bb3dcd404b1ec670a7084a47cabee81c0f1d0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1f3537f743b7df96b82a46306d1852d5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一比二，施晗拿到破发点。她用反手打出角度，把比分追回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "af0b3dd3678787c966ca6860e9c0ac8c806bc3326859801db4f8c05d117c9a16",
      "words_sha256": "df99235cf254effea955bd606d69706a446965ae131ddafc503938cc86e7abeb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:19425dc72dcd9142436d4694193b88eba4bb8a7dbde6c2a223045f1bb3a1ceb6",
      "request_id": "19425dc72dcd9142436d4694193b88eba4bb8a7dbde6c2a223045f1bb3a1ceb6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0cf46d7a1ef7d89e142134e810b02ac7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一次，她没能跨过最后这道关。北京时间十月三十号晚上，广州四分之一决赛，施晗四比六、六比三、五比七惜败塔格尔。第一次走到巡回赛八强，她已经把机会握到了决胜盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "44f40c729df0f6419f03c28b2f489b14b91412d05d1f44725faad90abe513374",
      "words_sha256": "3c55c959141e6f55c9514cdf5fbb3528b9ec9d4840226d4232e0e46abb70447c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2cc50ad7eb18d7d1f0caa72e498817508fe520fca7f38f42016393c8db234e0c",
      "request_id": "2cc50ad7eb18d7d1f0caa72e498817508fe520fca7f38f42016393c8db234e0c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d167ffb77bd4c34509c401c2da3afac5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "领先被追平，首盘来到三比三。施晗仍在底线咬住相持，双方都不肯先松手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "06ba36e12feadd6dd3891805218e99f4b88ba226dafd4a031ac81d85fd33e465",
      "words_sha256": "debaee3852dbea01dd818bff0e8eb1a28b8f2305f70f477f0358c8762d9726bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3183e077fa846c535a85dc955b70742da8017339d423fa07d2f9da8ddb3825e7",
      "request_id": "3183e077fa846c535a85dc955b70742da8017339d423fa07d2f9da8ddb3825e7",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "85b15943a253796aa23bbbf1db27b4cc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "走到网前，握手告别，这趟广州之旅结束了。遗憾很重，第一次巡回赛八强也是真的。愿施晗带着这些好球继续往前走。下一次握住领先，你最期待她把哪一个环节练得更稳？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c8fe2002e9be8cd5f8ce918b8d993bff07d367c3fdbc2bf48a431d6150de044c",
      "words_sha256": "325af8012f14564eb46608bd597aebe4ede3fd548c7d1bcf11c9d54ae8472fb4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5db93b7ac72bd838826e45694f2641aa1c3c94e99c5ddac0c274a88912c663dc",
      "request_id": "5db93b7ac72bd838826e45694f2641aa1c3c94e99c5ddac0c274a88912c663dc",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d7c7731a4b81ede618014ac913e34c7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四比三领先后，她继续把塔格尔调向两侧，等到机会，再把球送进空当。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4064a4e8fb0f0a30c2f2d2118de20538eab37b6aba76d8ef464cdcfe5dabc718",
      "words_sha256": "5b7ff56f68225f50c5941342995f2f873b6112342a201279b46506cff1b36a07"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:73c1460852bc27c6278c927bbc067456c31b73bc03de5552d07463467a190943",
      "request_id": "73c1460852bc27c6278c927bbc067456c31b73bc03de5552d07463467a190943",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5257014885f82f5743c8bc3b781abf3e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一个赛点，她救了回来，五比五。但到了五比六，自己的发球局，她仍然没能把比赛带进抢七。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8e775a686aa662c7167eeeca31f6f674165aba0ef1e7c723fa9fb50f0977bbe9",
      "words_sha256": "c8124783c78b423bfdcc17a3bab39ecec57bb722048362ecdee9e5cf024f8bff"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8bed8b999d05e2ffb64710d888a927e5eef444c8bb14a7890883c8ab184e1a0e",
      "request_id": "8bed8b999d05e2ffb64710d888a927e5eef444c8bb14a7890883c8ab184e1a0e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "434f2ac73808ac3e1fefd39d93221e9f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五比六，施晗拿到保发机会。双方在底线来回调动，她还在用正反手争取这一局。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0063bcc17213621a36aaf48919caf5544dc22bcc0e76ae022f11b379e75def7f",
      "words_sha256": "87ff0afff967e3d12d57449b3cef594d84344c12745e9752c0c1e3b08003b51b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9855661d4b65728731fc4fa27cedcade582e9c76d919b8947251b647f2628ed1",
      "request_id": "9855661d4b65728731fc4fa27cedcade582e9c76d919b8947251b647f2628ed1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "78fde872513b0f10944cca23b9af8e4e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "施晗打出二十六个制胜分，比对手更多。但五十八次非受迫性失误，决胜盘就有三十五次。她打出了冲击力，也为不稳定付出了代价。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "85031ccd046b5e3b875da85c8a0fb716f802d756bfa8b33c67e81bc978359409",
      "words_sha256": "b7826a2494895fa9a576b38b6334a3dde58dd1628dd78cf1d802dc8ab265d6d6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b46d61aa35f02b5fedb4e810962b6febf0941fd2e41de6a552a9cd15967a2a4a",
      "request_id": "b46d61aa35f02b5fedb4e810962b6febf0941fd2e41de6a552a9cd15967a2a4a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ad622c6c98db35f3d12539cf41456597",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四比五，对手拿到赛点。她仍然顶住相持，把球打回去，机会还没有结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f21d7c86104c93f9e5ddccf305528fbef30c12698af4fc6b021d021cfc854c1b",
      "words_sha256": "60cf49f8e1cefd06ac42b7fa9cbaacd082da519d2884a6dd92e2c248fda8786d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "82559ee833552ece2684d1fde38b1b444d06f8af9e0d91c91a130e2c2337c19d",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ba0f88ec241955100a3c28252215d540f6bb5d787d6243baf4e9a5efc86aeeb0",
      "request_id": "ba0f88ec241955100a3c28252215d540f6bb5d787d6243baf4e9a5efc86aeeb0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8702a6bdd0a7d37835222771bd7c0c7b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "施晗贴着底线左右移动，反手顶回去，再用正手把球送向另一侧。对手也始终没有退。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7e04dc833d130713916e4e1195683705b7077ee5408d11b1db2b6e16e3890653",
      "words_sha256": "f71f60e4cb59fb735db0dbb0096d67dc58a39d37be0b6c280ede99f330c6d232"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:caacd84d282d8785bf874b59398ff2abfb0d9df529801c880ca11cc6abeaffb9",
      "request_id": "caacd84d282d8785bf874b59398ff2abfb0d9df529801c880ca11cc6abeaffb9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c26b52ec1f76d1a91bdd8c8f28ad071b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "随后，她把比分带到四比二。但塔格尔连追三局，领先变成四比五，施晗又被推到必须守住的关头。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7352beb001bbff7e93b91767df08bf4a46cb585b9f9e14e2632304066ba1dbde",
      "words_sha256": "39a72fcab6c0f0251fee561db84609771197e5f5b42474695928861cc47aed57"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:da3aa3f8a3d80fdc1482f66c4889e393deb0a0e6f676516e20cb99b8166460a5",
      "request_id": "da3aa3f8a3d80fdc1482f66c4889e393deb0a0e6f676516e20cb99b8166460a5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a1a532f4563a64627d45b77bb7f3cc82",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六比三，一盘一盘拿回来。决胜盘，她先守住长局，又在一比一时争到破发机会，这次反手再添一分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7b05d374d97fc679bdb7c58120e5871696a9202e5561c1ba3851df0c5e1ee842",
      "words_sha256": "a2afb47a2e8b807620495803427c5694faba3ff4ea995549b5ab1534e8ae72d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e1fc089113c42f41fc39d6fffaae4d85cd5910367bff617d0b960d61124193b1",
      "request_id": "e1fc089113c42f41fc39d6fffaae4d85cd5910367bff617d0b960d61124193b1",
