        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "首盘四比六。第二盘又是零比二落后，施晗没有让比赛这样滑走，她追上来，再把主动拿回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0bbeff5e4b24ff12e9ffd27b267ed43984e0f1c88899eef14962adc5eb79c0e8",
